"It seems powersaved is running on this system. PowerDevil will not start if "
"other power managers are active. If you want to use PowerDevil as your "
"primary power manager, please stop powersaved and restart the PowerDevil "
"service."
msgstr ""
"U hetaj systemie pracuje słužba „powersaved”. Słužba „PowerDevil” nia budzie "
"dziejničać, kali ŭklučanyja inšyja kiraŭniki. Kali ty chočaš zrabić słužbu "
"„PowerDevil” hałoŭnaj, spyni słužbu „powersaved” i ŭklučy słužbu "
"„PowerDevil” nanoŭ."

